It is. And also, there doesn't seem to be any score here.

00:44:49.580 --> 00:44:54.960
So it feels like it's not trying to punish you with a made-up system.

00:44:55.420 --> 00:44:59.060
So it's just giving you a series of attempts.

00:44:59.320 --> 00:45:02.920
It's a little bit more clear, because it continues with scores.

00:45:02.940 --> 00:45:05.980
