But also that I was thinking a lot about, like, okay, how do I farm coins so I can have more chances to have more extra lives?

00:45:48.680 --> 00:45:54.220
And, like, it encouraged me to do those extra things rather than just get to the end of the level.

00:45:54.520 --> 00:46:05.960
Oh, man. I still, if I were to really, like, come up with my actual opinion, I still think that as much as I think that punishment nowadays in games is just too nonexistent, there needs to be more punishment for failing.

00:46:06.360 --> 00:46:21.740
