00:47:55.040 --> 00:47:56.800
So they didn't completely get rid of it.

00:47:56.800 --> 00:48:05.620
And I think that since this is based on a non-Mario game, it probably didn't have the same physics going into it.

00:48:05.720 --> 00:48:12.780
But it's still, it's still, like, a good, it's still a good system in that it still felt right.

00:48:13.020 --> 00:48:15.500
Oh, yeah, the jump is great for everybody, too.

00:48:15.580 --> 00:48:17.200
It feels, you know, it feels natural.

00:48:17.440 --> 00:48:21.980
It's not, it's not a jump that forces you into a direction that you can't change on the fly.

00:48:21.980 --> 00:48:26.540
I like that. Yeah, this is actually making me kind of realize, too, like, we talked before about how,

00:48:26.800 --> 00:48:30.500
the original game was a lot more about, like, run, jump, be precise.

